%% Runtime sequence for MCP tool execution and client-side explanation generation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User or study script
    participant Bot as Telegram bot / caller
    participant Client as MCP client
    participant Controller as ReAct controller
    participant Server as MCP stdio server
    participant Tools as Prediction and XAI tools
    participant Generator as Client-side explanation generator
    participant Gemini as Gemini LLM

    User->>Bot: Text sample and question
    Bot->>Client: run_mcp_pipeline or run_fixed_tool_pipeline
    Client->>Server: initialize stdio MCP session
    Client->>Server: list_tools
    Server-->>Client: predict_depression, explain_shap, explain_rag, explain_counterfactual
    Client->>Server: call_tool predict_depression(text)
    Server->>Tools: predict_proba and classify_severity
    Tools-->>Server: prediction payload
    Server-->>Client: structured prediction

    alt Adaptive ReAct path
        Client->>Controller: prediction, question, observations
        Controller->>Gemini: JSON action-selection prompt
        Gemini-->>Controller: next action or finish
    else Fixed study path
        Bot->>Client: fixed question type
        Client->>Client: map question type to tool action
    end

    loop Up to three explanation actions
        Client->>Server: call_tool selected explanation tool
        Server->>Tools: run raw SHAP, RAG, or counterfactual pipeline
        Tools-->>Server: raw result object
        Server-->>Client: serialized raw result
        Client->>Client: deserialize and record observation
        opt Adaptive path continues
            Client->>Controller: updated observations
            Controller->>Gemini: next-action prompt
            Gemini-->>Controller: next action or finish
        end
    end

    Client->>Generator: raw result set and prediction
    Generator->>Gemini: final explanation prompt
    Gemini-->>Generator: natural-language explanation
    Generator-->>Client: final explanation
    Client-->>Bot: result dictionary
    Bot-->>User: explanation
